# Dr. Nibha Raghu Website - HTTP Routes Reference
# Base URL: Replace with your actual deployment URL
@baseUrl = https://dr-nibha-raghu-website.vercel.app
# @baseUrl = http://localhost:3000  # For local testing

---

### 📄 Static Pages (GET)

#### Home Page
GET {{baseUrl}}/

#### About Dr. Nibha Raghu
GET {{baseUrl}}/about

#### Services
GET {{baseUrl}}/services

#### Patient Reviews
GET {{baseUrl}}/reviews

#### Contact & Location
GET {{baseUrl}}/contact

#### Book Appointment
GET {{baseUrl}}/book-appointment

