### 📋 Form Submissions (POST)
# Note: These forms currently only simulate submission (no backend)
# In production, you'd connect to a backend API or service like:
# - Formspree, Netlify Forms, EmailJS, or custom API

#### Contact Form (from /contact page)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "phone": "9876543210",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "preferredDate": "2026-09-20",
  "preferredTime": "10:00-11:00",
  "concern": "sinus",
  "message": "Chronic sinusitis for 6 months, need consultation"
}

#### Appointment Booking Form (from /book-appointment page)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/book-appointment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientType": "new",
  "name": "Jane Smith",
  "phone": "9876543210",
  "email": "jane@example.com",
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-05-15",
  "gender": "female",
  "preferredDate": "2026-09-22",
  "preferredTime": "14:00-15:00",
